THE MEMBERS OF THE ADVISORY BOARD MUST HAVE 
RELEVANT KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERTISE IN RECYCLING PROGRAMS OR THE 
IMPACTS OF COVERED MATERIALS ON THE STATE AND THE ENVIRONMENT. 
