FRONT RANGE. 
(3) THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR SHALL MAKE ALL APPOINTMENTS TO 
THE ADVISORY BOARD NO LATER THAN DECEMBER 31, 2022. THE 
APPOINTMENTS FOR INITIAL TERMS TO THE ADVISORY BOARD SHALL BE 
STAGGERED SO THAT SOME OF THE MEMBERS SERVE INITIAL TWO-YEAR 
TERMS AND OTHER MEMBERS SERVE INITIAL THREE-YEAR TERMS, AND ALL 
MEMBERS SERVE SUBSEQUENT TERMS OF THREE YEARS. THE EXECUTIVE 
DIRECTOR SHALL FILL ANY VACANCY BY APPOINTMENT FOR THE REMAINDER 
OF THE UNEXPIRED TERM. 
(4) THE ADVISORY BOARD SHALL CONVENE ITS FIRST MEETING NO 
LATER THAN MARCH 1, 2023. AT THE FIRST MEETING, THE VOTING MEMBERS 
SHALL SELECT A CHAIR AND VICE-CHAIR FROM AMONG THE VOTING 
MEMBERS FOR A TERM NOT TO EXCEED TWO YEARS, AS DETERMINED BY THE 
ADVISORY BOARD. THE ADVISORY BOARD SHALL CONDUCT ANNUAL 
MEETINGS AND MAY CONDUCT MEETINGS MORE FREQUENTLY UPON THE 
REQUEST OF THE CHAIR OR OF AT LEAST SEVEN OF THE VOTING MEMBERS OF 
THE ADVISORY BOARD. THE ORGANIZATION MAY PROVIDE TECHNICAL AND 
STAFF ASSISTANCE TO THE ADVISORY BOARD. 
(5) THE ADVISORY BOARD IS SUBJECT TO THE OPEN MEETINGS 
