(k) 
DESCRIBE THE PROCESS TO EVALUATE AND REVISE THE 
OBJECTIVE COST FORMULAS AS NECESSARY AND USING DOCUMENTED COSTS. 
IF THE PLAN PROPOSAL INCLUDES MORE THAN ONE OBJECTIVE COST 
