ADMINISTRATIVE AND REPORTING COSTS OF THE PRODUCERS AND THE 
ORGANIZATION; 
(n) DESCRIBE A PLAN THAT OUTLINES, IF THE ORGANIZATION CEASES 
TO EXIST OR CEASES TO ADMINISTER THE PROGRAM, HOW ANY PRODUCER 
RESPONSIBILITY DUES THAT HAVE NOT BEEN USED TO IMPLEMENT THE 
