BAGS ARE TRADITIONALLY PROVIDED TO CUSTOMERS. 
(b) "STORE" INCLUDES A FARMERS'' MARKET, ROADSIDE MARKET OR 
STAND, FESTIVAL, OR OTHER TEMPORARY VENDOR OR EVENT THAT INCLUDES 
TEMPORARY VENDORS. 
(c) "STORE" DOES NOT INCLUDE A SMALL STORE. 
25-17-504. Restrictions on use of single-use plastic carryout bag 
- inventory exception - repeal. (1) SUBJECT TO SECTION 25-17-505 (1), ON 
AND AFTER JANUARY 1, 2024, A STORE OR RETAIL FOOD ESTABLISHMENT 
