that needed to be addressed and 
resolution status of those gaps/issues. 
▪ Producer compliance activity reports. 
Provide an effective 
platform of support and 
interaction with local 
governments, commingled 
recycling processing 
facilities, and haulers that 
allow them to steadily 
improve their programs 
and facilities to meet 
regulatory targets and the 
goals of the RMA. 
▪ Application, reporting, invoicing, and 
informational platforms established that are clear, 
effective, and efficient for interested parties to 
use. 
▪ Mechanisms in place to use interest holder 
feedback for improving platforms. 
▪ Dispute resolution process developed that allows 
for arbitration 
▪ Number and kind of platforms in place 
for interaction with interested parties. 
