INSERT OR REPLACE INTO chunks (id,document_id,chunk_index,content,page,section,layer,jurisdiction,doc_date,license,material_tags,package_tags) VALUES ('or-caa-plan-2026-amend::0279','or-caa-plan-2026-amend',279,'190 
 
 
 
 
The following changes have been made to further harmonize material categories across states. These 
changes indentify materials that CAA intends to on-ramp while reflecting recycling system performance. 
o 
Break the category “PET (#1) Thermoformed Containers, Cups, Plates, Trays” and combine into “PET 
(#1) Lids) to re-form the following categories: 
