Appendix Q: 
Landfill Risk Assessment 
CAA Responsible End Market Verification: Disposal Site Risk 
Assessment Questionnaire 
To determine whether Disposal Sites receiving covered materials require further review by a verification 
body or can utilize the verification variance, these questions will be applied to assess their inherent risk. 
Disposal Entity Information 
Entity Name 
 
Address 
 
Point of Contact 
 
Email Address 
 
Phone 
 
 Risk Assessment 
Risk Assessment Question 
Yes/ No 
1. 
Is the disposal site operating in a country with a legal framework for waste 
management and pollution control? 
 
2. Has the disposal site provided any permit(s) or license(s) delivered by the 
relevant authorized authority? 
Non-permitted, illegally permitted, or falsified facilities will not receive a 
verification, as they are not considered a legal disposition site for a REM. 
 
3. Is the disposal site in full compliance with all applicable permit obligations? 
 
4. Are there no inconsistencies in potential site activity from satellite image 
data based on facility site address provided by entity? 
If cross checks on facility address show an inconsistency, CAA will follow-up to 
confirm facility location is accurate prior to commencement of verification. 
 
If the answer is “yes” to all questions, the variance for verification will apply. 
Variance Determination 
 
Confirmed By 
 
