INSERT OR REPLACE INTO chunks (id,document_id,chunk_index,content,page,section,layer,jurisdiction,doc_date,license,material_tags,package_tags) VALUES ('oa-pmc8162419::0034','oa-pmc8162419',34,'Losses for PET and HDPE/PP to other output fractions; synthesis of the primary information from the surveyed plants.
Polymers | Losses to: | Level of losses | Remarks
PET green bottles | other bottle fractions | Not observed | Relevant for plants with PET colour sorting
PET transparent bottles | other bottle fractions | Very low | Practically no improvement potential; maximum potential of mechanical and manual sorting has been reached; No market demand; would demand technical adjustment of the optical sensors at negative cost/benefit
